## Executive Summary

Claude Haiku 5.5 is Anthropic's flagship general-purpose model from the Claude Haiku 5.5 series, released in 2026, designed for complex reasoning, coding, and knowledge work. It features competitive pricing and strong performance across agentic benchmarks with optimized speed and extended context capabilities. The model ranks 85th overall with a score of 83.6/100, indicating strong performance in the frontier model landscape. Claude Haiku 5.5 is part of the Claude Haiku 5.5 series alongside Claude Haiku 5.5, Claude Haiku 5.4, Claude Haiku 5.3, and Claude Haiku 5.2, offering different capabilities and pricing tiers.

